title: Exfiltration via AWS CLI S3 Upload
id: f8e5b827-83c4-4f07-ae00-bbbd367f6ee5
status: experimental
description: Detects aws s3 cp/sync/mv uploading local data to an S3 bucket, which can move collected data to an attacker-controlled bucket outside the organization.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1567/002/
logsource:
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    CommandLine|contains: 'aws s3'
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'cp '
      - 'sync '
      - 'mv '
    CommandLine|contains: 's3://'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - User
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate S3 data workflows
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.exfiltration
  - attack.t1567.002
